[{"title":"寄题愚斋","author":"李兼","text":"巧鬻非善贾，利穫非良农。\n君子不自智，甘与庸人同。\n天君见独者，进退有新功。\n忽敛艺文手，反著怀袖中。\n客问以臆对，此说非易穷。\n吾非宁武子，今学北山翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62559,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游道宫","author":"李兼","text":"路去丛祠修竹林，插天松桧卧龙吟。\n翚飞朱阁阑干外，人在白云岩窦深。\n落花半逐流水逝，黄鹤一去莫烟沉。\n安得金丹蜕凡骨，一视往昔与来今。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62560,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蒹葭","author":"李兼","text":"蒹葭漫漫秋风多，陂池水落枯苇柯。\n青山断处落日下，欸乃一声渔子歌。\n高秋鲈肥贱如土，换酒村场醉迷路。\n夜深艇子舣前湾，依稀月照芦花浦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62561,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题冀缺图","author":"李兼","text":"耕夫自立苗且耘，饟妇相敬礼如宾。\n画工貌出态閒暇，不是如今愚野人。\n古之农者盖如此，馌彼公田同妇子。\n山林自信有真乐，隐逸传中无姓字。\n吾不能走马章台街，画眉狼籍贻讥谐。\n又不能卖酒临邛市，奔妻万古不灭耻。\n遗风后世岂无存，半在东阡烟雨村。\n不见杵臼梁家妇，犹能亲举案前餐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62562,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题画","author":"李唐","text":"云里烟村雨里滩，看之如易作之难。\n早知不入时人眼，多买胭脂画牡丹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62563,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"李宾","text":"自笑资中穷太守，每逢水竹便相亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62564,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"合江亭","author":"李恭","text":"一丝风下碧云天，亭上窗开霁色鲜。\n严子钓台青树里，桐君丹灶白云边。\n千家画栋前朝屋，百里清江过客船。\n潇洒桐庐几兴废，野花山鸟自年年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62565,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饮城楼","author":"李振祖","text":"山外晴云数点鸦，寸心芳草共天涯。\n夕阳城上游人少，十二栏干杨柳花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62566,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浪淘沙令","author":"李振祖","text":"春在画桥西。\n画舫轻移。\n粉香何处度涟漪。\n认得一船杨柳外，帘影垂垂。\n谁倚碧阑低。\n酒晕双眉。\n鸳鸯并浴燕交飞。\n一片闲情春水隔，斜日人归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62567,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月十六日离鄂渚","author":"李流谦","text":"一萍泛泛几时休，昨日黄州又鄂州。\n醉语醒来都不记，小湾才转失南楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62568,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二月十七日同子友过宇文氏庄观海棠二绝 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"长桥纳纳袅东风，倒射斜阳千丈红。\n晚色自佳人不见，青山翠雾碧波中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62569,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二月十七日同子友过宇文氏庄观海棠二绝 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"渐老花羞人不羞，枉因风雨结春愁。\n意行忽欲江东去，锦帐三分半未收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62570,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口占","author":"李流谦","text":"午照当窗树影疏，静听㶁㶁水鸣除。\n便将一日平分了，半用酣眠半读书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62571,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小孤二绝句 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"蜀犀无用苦奔忙，百尺江心如许长。\n无数鸬鹚巢彻顶，只将险绝作寻常。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62572,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小孤二绝句 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"瑶池缥缈是吾家，尝忆清觞覆九霞。\n雾鬓风鬟天下饰，可须人世俗铅华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62573,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予客三池王正卿以四绝见寄次其韵 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"山房锁剑涩生尘，独鹤沙边久念群。\n我有好诗谁画得，一江残照数峰云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62574,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予客三池王正卿以四绝见寄次其韵 其四","author":"李流谦","text":"我来在处说君名，小轴人争睹凤星。\n放却他时能致此，定知阮眼为君青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62575,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予客三池王正卿以四绝见寄次其韵 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"梦中行尽好山川，照水征鸿影自寒。\n若向紫岩楼上过，为传片纸报平安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62576,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予客三池王正卿以四绝见寄次其韵 其三","author":"李流谦","text":"佳人望断日平西，可意相逢眼底稀。\n漫说携家终是客，开愁唯有醉淋衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62577,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云庄耕者","author":"李吕","text":"莘野乐尧舜，谷口岂真卿。\n自是不可掩，区区非近名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62578,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长滩","author":"李流谦","text":"乍脱惊涛恐，犹为曲木看。\n昔人憎胜母，吾亦畏长滩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62579,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"对月戏简坐客","author":"李流谦","text":"夜凉溪月等閒斜，半折寒芦委雪花。\n一叶与君从此逝，松江烟雨著浮家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62580,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瓜步两绝 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"阿坚狼狈伏狸奔，岂是长江解有神。\n犹忆当年南伐语，会知正朔不归人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62581,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瓜步两绝 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"颠风恶浪雨喧豗，往事愁中一笑咍。\n江上有人来吃酒，故应虎子是琼杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62582,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"先公三池祠室学官相传占为公署同年李南才毅然欲复其旧贻以四绝句 其三","author":"李流谦","text":"一椽不得留遗爱，百世宁能保奉尝。\n豚犊无称益先美，碎碑伐树亦寻常。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62583,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"先公三池祠室学官相传占为公署同年李南才毅然欲复其旧贻以四绝句 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"老仙有力在斯文，廪士馀粮但一尘。\n列屋诵弦知所自，杏坛今秀几株春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62584,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"先公三池祠室学官相传占为公署同年李南才毅然欲复其旧贻以四绝句 其四","author":"李流谦","text":"一念爱亲无彼此，向来情义笃年家。\n稍伸九地幽幽恨，此事期君可咄嗟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62585,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"先公三池祠室学官相传占为公署同年李南才毅然欲复其旧贻以四绝句 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"末俗何由到古人，伤心祠室漫名存。\n风榱雨栋那堪说，石刻污漫像设昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62586,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次才夫韵二绝 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"灯窗仍有卷披黄，此地重来似故乡。\n安得清江都是酒，胜金满屋笏堆床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62587,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次才夫韵二绝 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"木生殊不愿青黄，雨露根深无有乡。\n台省从渠登衮衮，未妨老子卧胡床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62588,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再游蒋山 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"六经岂解亡人国，万卷平生最苦辛。\n只作卧龙嗟晚悟，当年人畏近前嗔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62589,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再游蒋山 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"寒山寺里立斜晖，只有垂杨自在垂。\n不待新亭成洒涕，向来已识宁馨儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62590,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏赠智渊师二偈 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"芙蕖元不植高原，插向红炉色更鲜。\n拖取门前担粪汉，满堂金玉富熏天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62591,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有以状元红牡丹见遗戏作一绝","author":"李流谦","text":"含笑嫣然灿晓霞，龙头一种绝诸家。\n东风有意怜枯蘖，乞与佳名不乞花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62592,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次乐碛","author":"李流谦","text":"客里何曾得展眉，偶逢一笑莫相违。\n酒浓烛暗真宜醉，风色萧萧愁欲归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62593,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次黄仲甄峡中韵二绝 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"连日舟横拍岸风，祗应身世在疏篷。\n旅床独茧皆愁绪，青镜明朝即老翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62594,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次黄仲甄峡中韵二绝 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"众流自作一门去，老子閒为三峡游。\n弭棹初逢云雨馆，转帆便是帝王州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62595,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵立春后馀寒二首 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"绛帐何时得罢开，为君叹息首空回。\n亦知弹铗无人听，收拾清诗分付梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62596,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵立春后馀寒二首 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"挟冷朝阳未吐光，小池犹有夜来霜。\n东君自识沈潜意，谁道阴柔解变刚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62597,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵嘲落梅代梅答二绝 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"不是春愁减素肌，从来鹤骨可能肥。\n便将梦里一般看，恐是幽人作蝶飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62598,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵嘲落梅代梅答二绝 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"吹开吹落本无心，万物自秋还自春。\n若把秾花校枯寂，本无诸妄亦无真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62599,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江月二首 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"皎皎映澄漪，千寻没到时。\n篙师轻转橹，可惜碧琉璃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62600,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江月二首 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"秋江与秋月，谁遣恰相和。\n借我蓑衣著，三人亦未多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62601,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"大小孤山专绝险，上中水府柄幽权。\n行人股慄船头拜，小艇横江来觅钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62602,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"帆风不饱橹声迟，正是波平月上时。\n今夜不知何处泊，买鱼沽酒犒舟师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62603,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观渔舟","author":"李流谦","text":"晚晴吏退漫凭栏，注目溪光巧映山。\n忽见渔郎轻荡桨，宛如相见在花间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62604,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芜湖即事三首 其三","author":"李流谦","text":"社风连日舟行迟，社公有马谁能骑。\n不妨酌我盎中绿，依旧离骚醉读时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62605,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芜湖即事三首 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"南人重鱼长食鲜，小鱼弃掷不论钱。\n老翁操网儿弄桨，一家生理在渔船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62606,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芜湖即事三首 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"烧痕吹尽荻芽生，江南二月春禽鸣。\n閒倚柁楼看远水，依依杨柳故园情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62607,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"信口十绝 其四","author":"李流谦","text":"只须终日醉腾腾，冷看荣枯本不曾。\n蚁子侧坡逢白雨，娄啰与钝两无凭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62608,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"信口十绝 其六","author":"李流谦","text":"园林换叶日初长，竹阁莲塘意思凉。\n除却种花并酿酒，更无一事可思量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62609,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"信口十绝 其九","author":"李流谦","text":"慕陶徵君吾本意，我亦能耕妻肯锄。\n赢得少年腰脚健，芒鞋却自胜肩舆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62610,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"信口十绝 其三","author":"李流谦","text":"漫说昭君第一人，毡车万里托羌浑。\n君王下诏求倾国，不为琵琶略断魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62611,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"信口十绝 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"缚虎断蛟空有意，毁车杀马且偷閒。\n凭君呼我为居士，一味临流与看山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62612,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"信口十绝 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"细雨萧萧懒出门，炉薰消尽有馀温。\n案头不著閒文字，时把楞严信手翻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62613,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"信口十绝 其七","author":"李流谦","text":"庭前幽草何人种，又是缘阶数尺长。\n主管风光元要此，可怜魏紫与姚黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62614,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"信口十绝 其五","author":"李流谦","text":"山僧三十尚童乌，危坐相看一语无。\n沸鼎可怜鱼欲烂，不知眼底著冰壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62615,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"信口十绝 其八","author":"李流谦","text":"早眠晏起从疏懒，醉舞狂歌任性灵。\n丈八蛇矛胸次著，人言屈子愧刘伶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62616,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姚和中母夫人年八十二殊增独无之叹因遗小罂使归为寿副以一绝","author":"李流谦","text":"舍肉增长叹，分甘助浅斟。\n赠君椒柏酒，慰我蓼莪心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62617,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客中二绝 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"角声定自与谁语，月色不应无为明。\n已作杨花著泥久，无多心事惹愁生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62618,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客中二绝 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"客中有梦自难成，未了风声又雨声。\n二十五声秋夜点，谁人数得甚分明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62619,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"彦博归自剑阳其家梅已半落作诗见示因次其韵 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"溪水泠泠欲雪天，风鬟雾鬓不胜寒。\n定同子美鄜州月，应恨闺中只独看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62620,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"彦博归自剑阳其家梅已半落作诗见示因次其韵 其三","author":"李流谦","text":"爱惜浓香恐过时，刘郎何事苦归迟。\n只应昨夜幽窗梦，飞到君边未可知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62621,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"彦博归自剑阳其家梅已半落作诗见示因次其韵 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"为问春从何处归，晚村烟雨细丝丝。\n从来漏泄冤庭柳，点检分明是此枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62622,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"霜乾木脱气坚明，病骨惊寒亦强行。\n折得梅花全未吐，不应于我尚含情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62623,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"围炉独拥夜深红，已是摧颓一老翁。\n断简半披还半掩，如今不作蠹书虫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62624,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海棠","author":"李流谦","text":"十二仙人玉琢栏，带晴带雨总宜看。\n东君不许寻常见，可忍狂风满地残。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62625,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其十","author":"李流谦","text":"仲明我友一肝肠，爱子慇勤出妙方。\n病后药囊真壁垒，老来贝叶是资粮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62626,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其六","author":"李流谦","text":"未老形骸足自支，唯忧多病酿成衰。\n诗书犹作发丘将，稽首竺乾真我师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62627,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其四","author":"李流谦","text":"畏日得凉才小惬，因秋感岁却成悲。\n君看八万四千劫，只在炉熏起灭时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62628,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其三","author":"李流谦","text":"黄流衮衮蹴天来，截岸夷洲不可裁。\n凫鹜疆封遽如许，莫贪浩渺径须回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62629,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"小溪浅涸如焦釜，一雨朝来万马奔。\n举手栏边誇海若，已无馀沥到瓶盆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62630,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"骄阳前日拟镕金，积雨逢秋却厌淫。\n本自乘除无德怨，枉劳嗔旱复嗔霖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62631,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其八","author":"李流谦","text":"有弟书来唤我归，客情偏觉雨声知。\n恰当浊浪粘空际，正是青山到梦时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62632,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿白羊二绝 其二","author":"李流谦","text":"古柳维舟带暝阴，夜寒剪剪到衣棱。\n客中不觉年华换，小市人家已试灯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62633,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿白羊二绝 其一","author":"李流谦","text":"入得瞿塘始敛愁，峡山行尽放眉头。\n澄江一道元如许，自在身心自在舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":62634,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]